<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/SKILL.md/s001/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/SKILL.md/s001> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "name: architecture-db\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/SKILL.md/s001/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/SKILL.md/s001> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/SKILL.md/s003/b1>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/SKILL.md/s003/b2>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/SKILL.md/s003/b3> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2817, djr:R-2818 ;
    djr:text "description: 관계형 데이터베이스 설계 지식 — ERD·정규화·역정규화, 인덱스 아키텍처(B+Tree·복합·커버링·부분), 제약조건·중복 방지·멱등성 저장소, 트랜잭션·격리 수준·락·Risky Write, outbox 전달 보장, 쿼리 최적화(EXPLAIN ANALYZE·N+1), 운영 rollout/backfill/migration safety, 계층·상속 모델링 패턴. 데이터 신뢰성·인덱스 전략·트랜잭션 경계·outbox 전달 보장·스키마 rollout을 결정할 때 먼저 로드한다. Django ORM·마이그레이션 코드 구현은 implementation-django, 도메인 이벤트 채택 여부는 architecture-ddd로 위임.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/SKILL.md/s001/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/SKILL.md/s001> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "user-invocable: false\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/SKILL.md/s001/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/SKILL.md/s001> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/SKILL.md/s003> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "## 언제 쓰나"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/SKILL.md> ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/SKILL.md/s003/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/SKILL.md/s003> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2819 ;
    djr:text "\n관계형 DB 아키텍처 결정(데이터 모델링·인덱스 설계·제약조건·트랜잭션 격리·락 전략·멱등성 저장소·outbox 전달·rollout 안전성)이 필요할 때 로드한다. 경계:\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/SKILL.md/s003/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/SKILL.md/s003> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2820 ;
    djr:text "- Django ORM·마이그레이션 코드 작성 → `implementation-django`\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/SKILL.md/s003/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/SKILL.md/s003> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2821 ;
    djr:text "- 도메인 이벤트 채택 여부·애그리거트 경계 → `architecture-ddd`\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/SKILL.md/s003/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/SKILL.md/s003> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2822 ;
    djr:text "- REST 계약·API 멱등성 키 정책 → `architecture-api`\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/SKILL.md/s004> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "## 핵심 운영 원칙"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/SKILL.md> ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/SKILL.md/s004/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s019-4.2/b1>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s021-5/b1> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2823, djr:R-2824 ;
    djr:text "\n- 성능 최적화 순서를 지킨다: 슬로우 쿼리 최적화 → 인덱스 적용 → 캐시 → 역정규화. 역정규화는 최후 수단이며, 정규화 먼저 한 뒤 필요한 경우에만 적용한다 (§4, §5)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/SKILL.md/s004/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2825, djr:R-2826 ;
    djr:text "- 복합 인덱스는 선택도 높은 컬럼을 앞에, 커버링 인덱스로 Index-Only Scan을 목표로, 부분 인덱스로 쓰기 비용을 최소화한다 — 인덱스 설계는 실제 액세스 패턴 기반으로 결정한다 (§7)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/SKILL.md/s004/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s032-8/b1>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s036-8.4/b1> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2827, djr:R-2828 ;
    djr:text "- 비즈니스 불변식이 DB 경계에서 지켜져야 하면 unique constraint·FK·check constraint를 사용하고, 제약조건 rollout은 lock risk를 고려한 단계적 순서를 따른다 (§8)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/SKILL.md/s004/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s041-9.4/b3>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s041-9.4/b4>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s041-9.4/b5>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s041-9.4/b6> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2829 ;
    djr:text "- 격리 수준은 필요 이상으로 높이지 않는다: 대부분의 OLTP는 Read Committed, 일관된 읽기가 필요하면 Repeatable Read, 정확성이 최우선인 금융·결제는 Serializable + retry (§9.4)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/SKILL.md/s004/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s043-9.6/b10>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s043-9.6/b11>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s043-9.6/b12>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s043-9.6/b1>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s043-9.6/b4>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s043-9.6/b5>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s043-9.6/b7>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s043-9.6/b9> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2830, djr:R-2831, djr:R-2832 ;
    djr:text "- Risky Write(주문·결제·재고·예약·권한·ledger)에는 Transaction owner·Locking strategy·Idempotency storage·Side-effect timing·Isolation/retry와 위험·failure 후보인 Test criteria를 명시한다. Test criteria 자체는 테스트 의무가 아니며, 독자 DB failure와 기존 보호를 비교한 `discipline-tdd` 입장 결정이 `add`일 때만 coder가 새 테스트를 작성한다 (§9.6)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/SKILL.md/s004/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s043-9.6/b14>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s044-9.7/b1>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s044-9.7/b2>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s044-9.7/b6>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s044-9.7/b7> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2833, djr:R-2834, djr:R-2835 ;
    djr:text "- 외부 결제·알림·메시지 발행은 DB 트랜잭션 내부에서 실행하지 않는다. 메시지 유실이 허용되지 않으면 트랜잭셔널 Outbox로 at-least-once 전달을 보장하고, consumer는 중복 수신을 무시할 수 있어야 한다 (§9.7)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/SKILL.md/s004/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s052-11.1/b1>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s052-11.1/b4>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s052-11.1/b5>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s052-11.1/b6>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s053-11.2/b2>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-db/references/final.md/s053-11.2/b3> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2836, djr:R-2837 ;
    djr:text "- 운영 컬럼·인덱스·constraint 변경은 Expand / Backfill / Contract 단계를 따르고, 대용량 backfill은 슬롯·lock risk를 고려한 배치 처리를 계획한다 (§11)\n\n"@ko .

